: ''Current version can be found [[Poison|here]].''

*Alpha 3.0: New card: Poison. COMMON Spell. SOUL: Perseverance. COST 1. EFFECT: Give KR to a monster.
*Beta 2.0: COST 1 > 0.
**Poison and [[Penetration]] were the first cards to cost 0 G.
*Beta 5.2: COST 0 > 1. EFFECT UPDATE: Give KR to a monster. Draw a card.
**Mirroring the update to Poison, [[Heal]] gained 1 cost and "Draw a card."
**This change was made because Perseverance decks focused on using spells, making Perseverance players short on monsters in hand.
*Beta 5.7: COST 1 > 0.
**Similarly, the cost of Protection and Heal became 0. Mirroring the updates to Heal and Poison, [[Protection]] gained "Draw a card."
*Beta 7.1: COST 0 > 2. EFFECT UPDATE: Deal 1 damage to an enemy monster. Draw a card.
**Beta 6.8 was a rework of every Soul. Dealing 1 damage at this time would give a monster KR.
*Beta 7.3: COST 2 > 1. EFFECT UPDATE: Give KR to a monster. Draw a card.
**Poison was reverted to the Beta 5.2 version because it was impossible to for Poison to give KR to cards such as [[Mad Dummy]] and [[Sans]] which couldn't take any damage.
*Beta 9.3: EFFECT UPDATE: Give KR to a monster. Add a Poison to your deck. Draw a card.
*Beta 33.0: Updated sprite.
**The Perseverance spells [[Pollutant Gas]], [[Termination]], [[Contamination]] and [[Siphoning]] also received updated sprites.
*Beta 44.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Deal 1 DMG to a monster and give it KR. Draw a card.
*Beta 49.0: EFFECT UPDATE: Deal 1 DMG to a monster and give it KR. If under KR, also draw 2 cards.
**This is similar to a past effect of [[Blitz Quiz]]'s Zap Cannon.
*Beta 54.0: COST 1 > 2.
*Beta 59.0: COST 2 > 1.
*Beta 62.1: COST 1 > 2. EFFECT UPDATE: Give a monster KR. Draw 2 cards.
*Beta 85.0: COST 2 > 1. EFFECT UPDATE: Loop (1). Give a monster KR. Draw a card.

